#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
fvpn - a free-VPN command line client for macOS.

Backend : mihomo (Clash.Meta) single binary, installed with `brew install mihomo`
Nodes   : free public subscription lists and/or your own subscription URL/file
Routing : TUN mode (every app, needs admin) or system-proxy mode (no root)

Usage:  fvpn -c            connect
        fvpn -d            disconnect
        fvpn -s            status
        fvpn -l            list nodes + latency
        fvpn -t            re-test all nodes, show the best
        fvpn -p 3          pin node #3 from `fvpn -l`
        fvpn -a            back to automatic best node
        fvpn -i <url|file> add a subscription
        fvpn -u            refresh node list
        fvpn logs          tail the backend log
"""

